WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
The gems possessed magical powers,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is starting right now
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things on my way
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk on a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and jumping all over the place
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from now
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
and soar high to the sky up there
ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:55.200
Lief and Barda arrived to fight against Gorl, the Golden Knight, but Barda was severely injured by Gorl's sword.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:03:01.000
The one who came to his aid was the girl they met in the Forest of Silence, Jasmine.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:06.700
Lief finally obtained the first gem, the topaz,

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:14.450
And the two companions, along with Jasmine, are about to enter the land occupied by the Sorceress Thaegan.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:18.500
Now, the three of them begin their adventure.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.800
The topaz was stolen...?

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:31.900
Fallow?!

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.250
My deepest apologies.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.700
Retrieve the gem immediately

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:41.400
And bring the thief who took the gem to me.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.580
Yes sir!

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.350
What horrible rain.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.600
You're such a wimp for being afraid of thunder.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.000
Knock it off!

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.200
Jasmine.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.200
Are you still upset?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.800
It's because we went this way.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:25.530
Even though I told you that this area is ruled by the Sorceress Thaegan.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:30.900
But, this is definitely the shortest route to get to the Lake of Tears.

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:36.550
Like I said, if we took a detour and went in from the south, we wouldn't have to go through Thaegan's territory.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:39.500
If we took that route, it would be five times the distance.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.950
Our chances of encountering the Grey Guards would increase as well.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:46.250
I also feel the same way as Barda.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.250
It's dangerous no matter where we go.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.800
Therefore, it's better to take a shortcut.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.100
We finally agree on something.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.400
It's two to one.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.800
Who objects to Lief?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.350
Two to three.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.350
Kree and Filli aren't people!

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:12.000
Thaegan gained her powerful magic after joining hands with the Shadow Lord!

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:17.500
If we continue this way, we're going to die before we even <i>get</i>  to the Lake of Tears.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.300
We still have to go!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:23.600
One of the gems is hidden there after all.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.800
She's been living on her own for a long time.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:34.500
She's not used to being in a group.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:39.000
I know that, but if it's like this now, then imagine later on.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.450
Stop doing that!

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.550
It's because we're speaking ill of his master.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:53.900
It's so calm around here.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:56.300
The only ones who are calm are you two.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.400
What's that?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.100
It's closed off. Maybe we can go around it?

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:14.950
Wait, Lief.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.400
I don't sense blood thirst from him.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:23.100
But isn't he attacking us?!

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.200
Who is this guy?

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.900
Maybe he's Thaegan's servant.

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.300
No!

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:38.600
While I am indeed guarding this place under Thaegan's orders,

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.500
I am not her servant!

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.000
What do you mean?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:50.300
A long time ago, I saved my companions' lives from Thaegan.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:55.600
For that, she got upset with me and forced me to guard this bridge.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:57.050
Barda!

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:02.550
Until the truth becomes a lie, and a lie becomes the truth.

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:07.200
"Until the truth becomes a lie, and a lie becomes the truth."

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.200
Hey, please!

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:10.700
Jasmine!

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.450
We have somewhere we need to be.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.500
Please let us through!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.100
Jasmine, stop!

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:24.200
Fine. Then answer the following riddle.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:27.670
If you get it right, I'll let you through.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.670
And if we get it wrong?

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:30.900
I'll slay you!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.900
What?!

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.900
Here's the riddle:

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:42.750
There are five sticks. Make it three without taking any away.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.450
What?

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:48.550
Make five into three without taking any of them away?!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:49.800
Impossible.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.800
Answer me!

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.700
Your time limit is reached when all the sand has fallen.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.150
Barda.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.200
Do you get it?

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.070
I don't.

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:11.500
"Make five into three without taking any away"...

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.500
Five into three...

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.650
I've got it!

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.200
You said "don't take any away",

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.000
But you didn't say "don't move them", right?

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.100
Here's the correct answer.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.100
Five turned into three!

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.200
Correct! You may pass!

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.050
Wait!

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.300
No go.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:45.400
Only those who answer my riddles correctly can pass.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.500
Jasmine,

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.800
Go on ahead.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:52.300
I heard you speaking.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.400
Then, this next riddle is for you!

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:59.750
Put these in order!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.150
In order?

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:05.420
What are these letters?

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:07.700
I've never seen them before.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.850
Or are they some kind of shapes?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:14.700
Barda...

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.200
I don't get it!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:23.000
In that case, I'll just have to fight him!

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:32.500
I see! I get it!

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:37.000
The reflection of the sword in the puddle was a clue.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.150
It's like a mirror.

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:41.600
This is 'one'.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:46.400
The numbers are symmetrical, like there's a mirror in between.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.600
This is 'five'!

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:59.900
Correct! You may pass!

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:04.700
Now...

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.500
The last question.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.400
Both of them were able to solve them.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.440
I'll be fine, too!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:17.600
Now, the song I'm about to sing has several creatures in it.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.600
It's long so pay attention.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.700
Sorceress Thaegan gulps her favourite food,

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:28.200
In her cave with all her brood.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.750
The names of her children are:

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.750
Hot, Tot, Jin

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.450
Jod, Fie, Fly

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:43.000
Zan, Zod, Pik, Snik, Lun, Lod and last of all the dreaded Ichabod.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.600
Each child holds a slimy toad.

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:52.600
On each toad squirm two fat grubs.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:56.550
On each grub ride two fleas brave.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.300
Here's my riddle and so beware,

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.300
Answer this riddle now if you dare,

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:06.900
How many things are living in Thaegan's cave?

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:09.900
Now, answer me.

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.000
Do your best Lief!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.900
If you take your time and think, you'll be fine!

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:20.700
"Sorceress Thaegan gulps her favourite food,

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.200
In her cave with all her brood."

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:26.500
"The names of her children are:

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.500
Hot, Tot, Jin,

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.600
Jod, Fie, Fly,

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:38.050
Zan, Zod, Pik, Skin, Lun, Lod and last of all the dreaded Ichabod."

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.600
"Each child holds a slimy toad."

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.450
"On each grub ride two fat grubs."

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:51.450
"On each grub ride two fleas brave."

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.300
"Here's my riddle and so beware,

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:58.400
Answer this riddle now if you dare,

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.600
How many things are living in Thaegan's cave?"

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.350
This is easy!

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:11.600
All thirteen children have one frog each.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:14.500
In other words, there are 13 frogs.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:19.900
Next, there are two grubs on each frog, so there are 26 grubs.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:24.950
On top of each grub, there are two fleas, so there are 52 fleas.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:27.100
Add them all up and it equals 104.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:32.350
My mother made me study mathematics everyday,

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.300
So questions like these are no problem.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.000
The answer is 104!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.500
That's right! I have to count Thaegan as well.

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:46.400
The answer is 105!

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:52.800
Wrong.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:56.000
Why?! The calculations are correct!

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:57.850
They are,

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:01.850
But you forgot Thaegan's favourite food,

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:04.600
The living raven that she was eating.

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:08.700
So that answer is 106.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.700
What?!

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:14.200
You said nothing about a raven being in her stomach...!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:19.000
It said in the song: "Thagean gulps her favourite food"!

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.300
That's unfair!

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.200
That's cheating!

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:41.600
Lief!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:46.150
I have to protect the belt.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.800
I'll have to throw it to Barda.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:53.000
If I can keep him under control until I take it off...

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:57.850
Lief!!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.550
You're an unfair liar!

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:06.600
You're the idiot who can't solve riddles!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:11.450
I guess it can't be helped that someone like you was put under Thaegan's spell, then!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.300
What?!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:17.700
"Until truth becomes a lie and a lie becomes the truth", until then,

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.600
Continue to protect this bridge!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:23.400
I'm neither unfair nor a liar!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:30.000
The Sorceress Thaegan took my freedom away and confined me here even though I did nothing wrong!

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.650
You said something interesting just now.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.850
If you're that interested in truth and lies,

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.250
I'll play one more game with you.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:44.500
This game will decide how you're going to be killed.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.900
I'll allow you to speak only once.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:52.300
If what you say is true, I'll strangle you to death.

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.900
If it's a lie, then you will be beheaded.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.150
Either way, you're going to kill me!

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:06.300
Come now, will you tell the truth, or lie?

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:07.700
Lief...

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.050
At this rate, either way he'll be killed!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.550
What am I supposed to do?

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:16.100
Please lend me your strength, Belt of Deltora.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.150
You will behead me.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.550
Didn't you hear me?

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:30.300
Is my answer the truth, or a lie? Answer me!

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.200
What just happened?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.500
I see!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:39.200
He said if Lief spoke the truth, he'd strangle him to death.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:47.550
But, if beheading him is the truth, he has to strangle him. Therefore, he can't behead him.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:54.000
He also said "if it's a lie, he'll be beheaded."

00:15:54.000 --> 00:16:00.200
Lief said 'behead me', and if what he said was a lie, then he would be beheaded.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:04.200
But if beheading Lief is the truth, he has to strangle him and can't behead him.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:09.100
Both options contradict each other, so he can't do anything!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.750
So he was a bird.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:33.350
"Until the truth becomes a lie, and a lie becomes the truth."

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:39.800
Lief, you broke his spell.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:44.850
You saved my life!

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:49.000
I'll return the favour one day!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:52.100
Stay well!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:06.700
Kree is scared...

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:15.750
Is he afraid of Thaegan because he'll be turned into a giant like him?

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:21.400
Kree's parents and siblings were kidnapped by Thaegan.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:31.400
It was right before he was about to leave his nest.

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.800
We're really similar, you know.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:40.700
Because both of our parents were taken away from us by the Shadow Lord's army.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:45.200
Kree and I have lived together for a really long time.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:50.300
But, that all ends today.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.750
I've made up my mind.

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.550
Go back to the forest.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:01.050
Jasmine! Are you sure?

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:08.850
If I make it back alive, I'll definitely return for you.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.200
Now go!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:13.950
Leave.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.400
Let's get going.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.950
Shall we take a little break?

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:34.700
Yeah.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.150
Jasmine,

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:40.800
Sorry.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:48.350
You had a perfectly good reason why you didn't want to go through where Thaegan ruled...

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:56.200
Thaegan hates anything that's alive, beautiful and free.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:04.650
The birds are saying something like this:

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:10.150
"Around the Lake of Tears, there was once a city called D'Or."

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:15.150
"D'Or means 'Golden City'."

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:20.200
"Beautiful flowers bloomed everywhere in that place, and the trees were very tall."

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:25.900
"In the golden city, people were living happily."

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:30.050
"But now, everything has been abandoned."

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:32.750
"This is Thaegan and her children's doing."

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:34.950
Thaegan...

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:37.000
How can she be so terrible?

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:46.100
The trees of the forest are frightened.

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:49.050
The Grey Guards are close!

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:50.300
What?

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:51.800
There's a lot of them.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:52.750
This way!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:55.900
Climb the tree!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.500
We'll hide under the cloak.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.100
It looks like they have a prisoner with them.

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:18.100
He's a Ralad.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:20.200
A Ralad?

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:26.300
The Ralads were famous for building strong and functional buildings.

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:32.100
Since King Adin, they've been highly valued by Deltora's royalty.

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:34.600
I've heard of them before.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.900
They're the ones who built Del Castle.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.050
How awful...

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.000
Let's save him.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.100
Lief...

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:01.800
Our goal is to find all of the gems.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.900
We have to get moving.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:05.900
But we can't just leave him!

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:07.900
We can't save him right now.

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:09.950
If not now, then when?

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:12.300
Lief!

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:16.000
It can't be helped, then. My job is to follow the belt.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.500
Geez...

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.100
You don't have to be afraid.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:53.850
Let's go!

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:01.600
He's gone!

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.200
Where did he go?

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.250
Over there!

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:12.700
They're launching fire!

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:22.500
If they're Grey Guards, can we really escape?

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:08.600
The Golden- Eyed Giant.

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:14.700
The guardian of the bridge, he riddles those who want to cross the bridge, killing them if they can't answer.

00:24:14.700 --> 00:24:19.630
But, he is actually a raven who is under Thaegan's spell.

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:26.000
We were saved by a friendly old couple and were invited into their house.

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:30.500
We haven't realised their evil plans yet.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:31.300
Nij and Doj's Trap

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:33.900
Next time, 'Nij and Doj's Trap'!

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:34.600
Nij and Doj's Trap
